section NegJTPChain
open QseriesFormalization.Pending.Ch10HM

/-! #### The negative-`z` Jacobi triple product chain (`0 < a < b`)

We mirror HM's positive chain (`jLaurent_eq_tripleProductInf`) but instantiate Chan's finite
